### InverSeek Search Service - read-only HTTP checks
@base = http://localhost:7003

### Health -> 200 if a compatible index is published, otherwise 503
GET {{base}}/health

### One term, default pagination
GET {{base}}/search?q=love

### Multiple terms use AND
GET {{base}}/search?q=love%20truth

### Combined filters, uppercase code accepted
GET {{base}}/search?q=love&author=AUSTEN&language=EN

### Year is original publication year; NULL years do not match
GET {{base}}/search?q=love&year=1813

### Two pages with total independent of limit
GET {{base}}/search?q=love&offset=0&limit=1

###
GET {{base}}/search?q=love&offset=1&limit=1

### Empty page keeps the actual total
GET {{base}}/search?q=love&offset=2147483647

### Valid no-match query -> 200 with total=0
GET {{base}}/search?q=nonexistentinverseekterm

### Invalid input -> 400 JSON
GET {{base}}/search?q=a

###
GET {{base}}/search?q=love&limit=101

###
GET {{base}}/search?q=love&year=unknown

### Published metadata
GET {{base}}/books/1342

### Global facets
GET {{base}}/search/filters

### Unknown route -> 404 JSON
GET {{base}}/missing

### CORS preflight
OPTIONS {{base}}/search
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
